    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="954ab6d5-2e8c-587a-88d5-d199d223262d" activityNameId="43926115-47a8-5cda-873c-ad13fa787920" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Tap water, water balance according to MoeK 2013, at user</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Tap water, water balance according to MoeK 2013, at user
This process is based on the dataset "tap water, at user/kg/RER U" from Ecoinvent v2.2. The electricity consumption is regionalised. The water withdrawal and water emissions to water are regionalised. The water embodied in product (1 kg/kg) is not included and has to be accounted for in the processes, which use tap water.;
CAS number: 007732-18-5; 
Formula: H2O; 
UUID: 65623503-525b-3f2d-a69f-97f5f1fca86f
Infrastructure and energy use for water treatment and transportation to the end user. No emissions from water treatment.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Example of a water works in CH.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: Electricity mix approximated by electricity production in Peru.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_65623503-525b-3f2d-a69f-97f5f1fca86f.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
